WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.165
Taco: Look! Alex and Sue!

2
00:00:05.166 --> 00:00:07.657
Maxie: They are angry.

3
00:00:07.658 --> 00:00:12.360
Taco: Maxie, I am scared!

4
00:00:12.361 --> 00:00:16.583
Alex: Maxie! Taco! I am angry!

5
00:00:16.584 --> 00:00:21.453
Sue: Yes, we are very angry!

6
00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:23.340
Maxie: I'm sorry.

7
00:00:23.341 --> 00:00:25.358
Taco: I'm sorry too.

8
00:00:25.359 --> 00:00:28.285
Alex: That's okay.

9
00:00:28.286 --> 00:00:31.851
Maxie and Taco: We are very sorry.

10
00:00:31.852 --> 00:00:34.231
Sue: Wow!

11
00:00:34.232 --> 00:00:37.150
Maxie: It's my magic marker.

12
00:00:37.151 --> 00:00:43.182
Alex and Sue: Magic marker? What's that?

